<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="pcards" data-stagger><article class="pcard rv"><a class="ph" href="/hawaii-claim-guides/hurricane-deductibles-in-hawaii/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-satellite.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-satellite-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hurricane-satellite.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pc-b"><span class="meta">Sep 8, 2026 · 7 min read</span><h2><a href="/hawaii-claim-guides/hurricane-deductibles-in-hawaii/">Hurricane Deductibles in Hawaii: How They Work and What to Check</a></h2><p>A percentage hurricane deductible can be the biggest number on your claim. Here is how it is triggered, calculated and reviewed in appraisal.</p></div></article><article class="pcard rv"><a class="ph" href="/hawaii-claim-guides/condo-master-policy-vs-ho6/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-towers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-towers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-towers.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="645" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pc-b"><span class="meta">Sep 24, 2026 · 8 min read</span><h2><a href="/hawaii-claim-guides/condo-master-policy-vs-ho6/">Condo Master Policy vs HO-6: Who Covers What in a Hawaii Claim</a></h2><p>When a stack pipe bursts or a storm hits a tower, the AOAO’s master policy and your HO-6 each pay part. Here is how to sort it out.</p></div></article><article class="pcard rv"><a class="ph" href="/hawaii-claim-guides/documenting-wildfire-smoke-damage/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pc-b"><span class="meta">Oct 7, 2026 · 8 min read</span><h2><a href="/hawaii-claim-guides/documenting-wildfire-smoke-damage/">Documenting Wildfire Smoke Damage in Hawaii Homes</a></h2><p>Smoke and soot can reach homes the flames never touched. Here is how to document wildfire smoke damage so the claim reflects what is really there.</p></div></article><article class="pcard rv"><a class="ph" href="/hawaii-claim-guides/salt-air-corrosion-vs-storm-damage/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/metal-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/metal-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/metal-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pc-b"><span class="meta">Oct 22, 2026 · 8 min read</span><h2><a href="/hawaii-claim-guides/salt-air-corrosion-vs-storm-damage/">Salt Air Corrosion vs Storm Damage: How Claims Draw the Line</a></h2><p>Insurers often point to salt air and wear when a metal roof or lanai fails after a storm. Here is how that dispute is framed and where appraisal fits.</p></div></article><article class="pcard rv"><a class="ph" href="/hawaii-claim-guides/general-excise-tax-and-freight-in-estimates/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="720" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pc-b"><span class="meta">Nov 10, 2026 · 7 min read</span><h2><a href="/hawaii-claim-guides/general-excise-tax-and-freight-in-estimates/">General Excise Tax and Freight in Hawaii Repair Estimates</a></h2><p>Hawaii’s general excise tax, ocean freight and island labor can add real money to a repair. Here is how estimates should account for them.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the settlement is right?</h2><p>Send us the carrier’s estimate. We’ll review it and tell you what we see — no obligation.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-light" href="/contact-hawaii-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
